---
description: Guardrails for improving app/template views without breaking generators.
globs: "templates/**/*.md, docs/uiplan/**/*.md"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Treat `templates/` as canonical source for template content.
- Never hand-edit generated template mirrors in `framework/uipath_claude/templates/` unless explicitly requested.
- Preserve template placeholders and anchor headings used by generation tools.
- When changing section names, verify downstream references in `framework/mcp_server/tools/plan_uiplan.py`.
- Keep changes focused on view clarity (layout, flow, readability, usability) rather than broad refactors.
